            <ArticleTitle>[Use of non steroid anti-inflammatory drugs in modern clinical practice].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>66-75</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The article presents the review of current non steroid anti-inflammatory drugs, their mechanisms, principles of their modern classification and use in internal diseases practice. DICLOBERL has been found to be the drug of choice in acute and chronic pain management. A wide variety of the preparation of the medication allows us to have the most effective and safety form to guarantee good results.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
